---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout
  title="About — İlknur Gürcan"
  description="The story of painter İlknur Gürcan: from engineering to the Sardunya Painting Studio in Ankara."
  image="/images/artist.jpg"
>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-10">
    <p class="text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3">The Artist</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl text-ink font-light">İlknur Gürcan</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

      <!-- Photo -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] bg-warm/20 overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src={base + '/images/artist.jpg'}
            alt="İlknur Gürcan"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-full h-full border border-warm/30 -z-10"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Biography -->
      <div class="space-y-10">

        <div>
          <p class="text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4">From Engineering to Painting</p>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Born in Isparta in 1972, İlknur Gürcan studied at Ankara Science High School
              and graduated in Industrial Engineering from Bilkent University. She went on
              to work for many years as an engineer at ASELSAN and at TÜBİTAK ULAKBİM.
            </p>
            <p>
              The passion for painting she had pursued on her own since childhood gradually
              took shape under the guidance of the artists Mehmet Yılmaz, Nusret Dökmeci
              and Oktay Bingöl.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2011 she founded the <em>Sardunya Painting Studio</em>, which became both
              a home for her own work and a space where painting courses are held.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-warm/20 pt-8">
          <p class="text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4">Her Painting</p>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              İlknur Gürcan paints the daily social life of the contemporary city dweller.
              Her canvases focus on cafés, streets and the human figure.
            </p>
            <p>
              To carry fleeting light, the feeling of a moment and the quiet poetry of the
              street onto canvas... This is the impulse behind every one of her works.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-warm/20 pt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Education</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">Ankara Science High School</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">Bilkent University - Industrial Engineering</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Studio</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">Sardunya Painting Studio</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Ankara · since 2011</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Medium</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">Oil on canvas</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Exhibitions</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink">5 solo · numerous group shows</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-warm/20 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href={base + '/en/works'}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 bg-ink text-cream text-sm tracking-widest uppercase hover:bg-ink/90 transition-colors"
          >
            Explore the Works
          </a>
          <a
            href={base + '/en/contact'}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 border border-warm/40 text-warm text-sm tracking-widest uppercase hover:border-warm hover:text-ink transition-colors"
          >
            Get in Touch
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Teachers -->
  <section class="bg-soft py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3">Studied With</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink font-light mb-10">Her Mentors</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {['Mehmet Yılmaz', 'Nusret Dökmeci', 'Oktay Bingöl'].map(ad => (
          <div class="border-l-2 border-gold/50 pl-5">
            <p class="font-serif text-xl text-ink font-light">{ad}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center">
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
      İlknur Gürcan has taken part in many group exhibitions since 2008 and has held
      five solo exhibitions.
    </p>
    <a
      href={base + '/en/exhibitions'}
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-warm hover:text-ink transition-colors border-b border-warm/50 hover:border-ink pb-1"
    >
      See All Exhibitions
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </section>

</Layout>
